<div style="text-align: center;">
<blockquote>
<p>His flaming robes stream'd out beyond his heels,<br />
And gave a roar, as if of earthly fire,<br />
That scared away the meek ethereal hours<br />
And made their dove wings tremble. On he flared.</p>
<p>-Keats</p>
</blockquote>
</div>
<p>A collaborative effort between myself, Zhange, Cimmerian, and TheVolgun. Credit where credit is due, these three made this happen. Little exaggeration.</p>
<p>Many thanks to the multitude of people who looked this over in chat. We sincerely appreciate all the feedback you gave us. We hope you like the finished product!</p>

							</div>

								
