														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3671839">
									

<p>I like it.</p>
<p>I think the inclusion of the artwork is a good choice and helps to really make Hyperion come to life. In addition, the exploration log has a very claustrophobic atmosphere that really fits the environment being described. Meanwhile, the audio work is the quality to be expected with such talents as djkaktus, Cimmerian, and TheVolgun involved.</p>
<p>I can take or leave the supplement, as it comes across as mostly a exposition dump, but I can appreciate the detail and thought put into it.</p>
<p>+1. Here's to a great 2018.</p>

